[32m +## Pipeline Architecture[m
[32m +- **Solana Webhooks**: Helius Enhanced Webhook streams transactions to Cloudflare Worker `/hook`.[m
[32m +- **Worker & KV Queue**: Ingests, filters out SOL/stables, deduplicates mints, and maintains FIFO signal queue in KV. Serves Telegram Mini App at `/app`.[m
[32m +- **Phone Bot (Android / Termux)**: Polls `/signals` every 3s via `./run.sh`, updates heartbeat every 3m.[m
[32m +- **Safety Gate (`src/gate.js`)**: Verifies revoked mint and freeze authorities via Solana JSON-RPC, checks for malicious Token-2022 extensions (transfer hooks, permanent delegates, transfer fees), and aggregates top-10 wallet concentration (excluding program PDAs while properly identifying unfunded system wallets).[m
[32m +- **Paper Execution Engine (`src/paper.js`)**: Applies pessimistic 5% entry and 8% exit slippage, evaluating DexScreener quotes against:[m
[32m +  - Stop-loss (`-25%`)[m
[32m +  - Take-profit half (`+100%`)[m
[32m +  - Trailing stop (`-20%` from peak once armed at `+50%`)[m
[32m +  - Sideways time-stop (`180s` in calibrated band)[m
[32m +  - Liquidity drop (`-30%` from entry)[m
[32m +  - Max hold duration (`30m`)[m
[32m +  - Missing quote timeout (`12` ticks)[m
[32m +- **Logging & Telemetry**: JSON lines recorded to `logs/paper.jsonl`, summarized via `src/stats.js`.[m
